	<content contentuid="h8a6460ebgeb96g4753g9972ga160d80c610b" version="1">If you worship &lt;b&gt;Tyr&lt;/b&gt;, you gain &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;all&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;Ability Checks&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;b&gt;damage&lt;/b&gt;, and &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;Initiative&lt;/b&gt;. You also have &lt;b&gt;Advantage&lt;/b&gt; on &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;Constitution&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h5ae2b5c5g755ag4516gb6f1g807ded07e081" version="1">If you worship &lt;b&gt;Tyr&lt;/b&gt;, you gain &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;all&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;Ability Checks&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;b&gt;damage&lt;/b&gt;, and &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;Initiative&lt;/b&gt;. You also have &lt;b&gt;Advantage&lt;/b&gt; on all &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h3bfdba8dg4035g4f17g80f2g0629cd28acba" version="1">If you worship another deity, or believe in no one but yourself, you gain &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;all&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;Ability Checks&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;b&gt;damage&lt;/b&gt;, and &lt;b&gt;Initiative&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h274f0601g36aeg448egb3bdgc6ef49abdcbc" version="1">If you worship another deity, or believe in no one but yourself, you gain &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;all&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;Ability Checks&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;b&gt;damage&lt;/b&gt;, and &lt;b&gt;Initiative&lt;/b&gt;. You also have &lt;b&gt;Advantage&lt;/b&gt; on all &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="hbaafe657g3f02g4ce0g8b89geb9a585198bc" version="1">Upon taking a &lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;Critical Hit&lt;/LSTag&gt;, you gain the blessing of &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ARMOURH101"&gt;Tyr's Aegis&lt;/LSTag&gt; and &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLADE_WARD"&gt;Blade Ward&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>
